            1 pc 0.1 uF / 100 V ceramic capacitor                                         1 pc 0.1 uF / 100 V ceramic capacitor
            1Pcs 1000µF/16V/Low ESR Aluminum/ø10x20             120         mVpp         Add 1 pc 10µF/16 V/X5R/1206                           50       mVpp

